StudyBuddy Global is an AI-powered peer-to-peer learning platform that connects students from around
the world to learn, teach, collaborate, and grow together. The platform combines social learning, intelligent
matchmaking, gamification, and AI assistance to create a modern educational community where knowledge is shared without borders.

Users can create profiles, discover study partners, chat with learners worldwide, earn XP and achievement badges,
build learning streaks, explore trending educational topics, and receive personalized guidance from Buddy,
an AI assistant that will eventually be available on every screen of the application. Buddy is designed
to act as an intelligent learning companion capable of understanding user needs and providing accurate educational assistance.

The project follows a modern full-stack architecture with a responsive frontend and a Flask + PostgreSQL backend.
User authentication is secured using JWT, passwords are encrypted with Bcrypt, and the database is managed using SQLAlchemy and Flask-Migrate.

Features
🌍 Global student community
🤖 Buddy AI assistant
💬 Real-time learning chats
🎯 Find study partners and mentors
📚 Subject-based learning
🏆 XP, Levels, Streaks & Badges
🔒 Secure authentication with JWT
🚫 User reporting and blocking system
👤 Personalized user profiles
📈 Gamified learning experience
📱 Responsive and modern UI

