🚀 Vision
Our vision is to build the world's largest student learning community where anyone can instantly connect with learners across different countries,
ask questions, share knowledge, and learn with the help of advanced AI. StudyBuddy Global aims to make quality education collaborative,
engaging, and accessible to everyone.
